# tests/cffi.rs::failed_rebind_rejects_stale_cffi_cache at tests/cffi.rs:2717; hand-port
# Claim: when a changed header no longer binds, the compiler reports E3208 and does not consume the old cache; the old bytes stay on disk unchanged (tests/cffi.rs:2743-2753)
